  "definitions": {
    "input": "The two suspended bodies share the receiving basin. The initial terrain and rectangle order come from the identical local Workbench file.",
    "bulk_ramp": "Rightmost floor-bound eight adjacent columns with >=510 stored units each. Window x740..1008. The probe also counts floor-connected units in each downstream x band, a separate film front and airborne parcel mass.",
    "bulk_surge": "32x32 full cells on y160 floor, mirrored initial block x240..271. Drop starts 32 rows above floor. Grounded mass requires continuous vertical Water to local floor. Bulk front requires eight adjacent columns >=255 units each. Mass-weighted travel sums grounded units times horizontal distance from the initial footprint divided by the total initial units. Probe time excluded.",
    "slope_surge": "Floor rises one row per two columns after 16 initially dry columns; plateau 48 rows above the old floor, 16 above the initial free surface. High-grade Water includes only floor-attached stored units above the specified terrain elevation.",
    "bank": "Flood-fill four-connected Water from trough x960..1008, clip x960..1055,y288..505, then measure x992..1055. Peak run-up is the highest five-column mean surface (>=64 stored units per visible cell) relative to the current median interior surface x968..983. Fixed-elevation fraction sums mass above y453 across all samples from t900..1500, divided by sampled connected mass over that same interval.",
    "source_shape": "Five-column maximum mean grounded depth, left x140..350 and right x630..740. RMS adjacent second differences measure pointiness. The top-grid y includes detached cells, excluding parcels.",
    "timing": "Fresh native processes in the recorded order. All agent builds, tests and graphical runs paused. An existing owner Workbench remained open. 900 timed World::tick calls each, probes outside the timer at t0/900. Includes startup ticks. Native host timing excludes Godot and Rapier. Values are individual run quantiles. No monotonic machine-frequency or OS load guarantee."
  },
  "shared_profile_options": "spill=1 ballistic=1 sheet_rate=64 draw=127 fall=8 launch_budget=128 coyote_ticks=4 level_shift=3 damp_shift=16 calm_damp_shift=8 calm=128 stick=128 sleep_after=90",
  "profile_options": {
